WEBVTT

00:05:59.747 --> 00:06:01.986
Jam perpjekur per disa kohe,

00:06:01.986 --> 00:06:05.743
dhe kur ndjehesha e merzitur, shtiresha.

00:06:05.743 --> 00:06:08.409
Sjellja, sjellja.

00:06:08.409 --> 00:06:11.143
Si stervitem une? Stervitem duke thene po

00:06:11.143 --> 00:06:12.954
te cfaredo gjeje qe me del perpara:

00:06:12.954 --> 00:06:15.732
drames, komedise, tragjedise,

00:06:15.732 --> 00:06:18.724
dashurise, vdekjes, humbjeve.

00:06:18.724 --> 00:06:20.806
PO, jetes.

00:06:20.806 --> 00:06:24.237
Dhe stervitem duke u perpjekur
te qendroj e dashuruar.

00:06:24.237 --> 00:06:25.690
Nuk eshte se fuksionon gjithmone,

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.544
por nuk mund te me fajesosh
mua qe perpiqem.

00:06:28.544 --> 00:06:31.043
Dhe, si shenim perfundimtar,